WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
1. Start with all six source records
Keep the parsed Source rows before automatic promotion or type conversion.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
2. Remove only the two report rows
The real heading is now the first row. It is still a row, not a data record.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
3. Promote the real header once
One row becomes column names. All three inventory records survive.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
4. Assign types after promotion
Keep item_id as Text. Quantity becomes a whole number; the zero remains.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
5. Reconcile the complete result
The repeated 0012 IDs belong to different regions. Do not remove either row.
